g B: 90w × 130h × 4d\n\nBox would be:\n- width = max(60, 90) + 7 = 97\n- height = max(80, 130) + 7 = 137\n- depth = (3 + 4) + 7 = 14\n\nThis is because paintings are stacked (depths add up) and the box only needs to be as wide/tall as the biggest painting."},{"role":"user","content":"ok ok, so what wrapping number is hardcoded rn"},{"role":"assistant","content":"**7cm.** The `PADDING` constant is now 7, added to every dimension (width, height, and total stacked depth).","reasoning_content":"The user is asking what the wrapping padding value is now. I changed it from 3 to 7."},{"role":"user","content":"make the default \"depth\" since it isn't always filled, to be 4 cm, and remove the \"frame thickness in cm\" words that are in the depth writing box"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_cz3wARPqx8HLGWUEoYL56775","type":"function","function":{"name":"read","arguments":"{\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Joe\\\\Downloads\\\\Magazine_prototype_backup\\\\lib\\\\shipping.js\",\"offset\":63,\"limit\":15}"}}],"reasoning_content":"The user wants:\n1. Default `depth_cm` to be 4 when not filled in the shipping calculator\n2. Change the placeholder text \"Frame thickness in cm\" to just be about depth\n\nLet me find where these are."},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_cz3wARPqx8HLGWUEoYL56775","content":"[Tool execution was interrupted]"},{"role":"user","content":"make the default \"depth\" since it isn't always filled, to be 4 cm, and remove the \"frame thickness in cm\" words that are in the depth writing box"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_BxkW9BVUQ0keC1Kf8F0U2866","type":"function","function":{"name":"grep","arguments":"{\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Joe\\\\Downloads\\\\Magazine_prototype_backup\",\"pattern\":\"Frame thickness|depth_cm\",\"include\":\"*.js\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"The user wants two things:\n1. In the shipping calculator, make the default for `depth_cm` be 4 (currently it's already `d = Number(item.d